{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Linked Worlds",
    "steam_appid": 2015360,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015360/extras/a674f3332c03108a1e3068db3f5410fb.webp?t=1680376168\" /></div><br>Explore the continent of Cestina, fight against enemies in tactical battles, and become powerful enough to defeat a threat that keeps getting stronger with every day.<br>Time will play an important role, being the prime factor for events, quests, monsters behavior, shops opening time, and much more.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015360/extras/5970ef6efde66e26658b5c950cf052a0.webp?t=1680376168\" /></div><br>Eleven years ago, the Dark Beast appeared from the Sky Tower, spreading its curse through the continent of Cestina until it was sealed by the four heroes.<br>Now that the beast has broken its seal, with the heroes nowhere to be found and a continent that hasn't yet recovered, it's up to Albus, adopted son of King Magnus, to defeat the Beast once and for all before it regains its full powers.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015360/extras/5319cd538c29785a6163d263f058c95c.webp?t=1680376168\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Tactical battles with grid-based-movement. <br></li><li>100 abilities to learn, allowing flexible playstyles.<br></li><li>Optional places and enemies, including super bosses.<br></li><li>In-game clock - Time will advance by walking, or doing actions like sleeping or fishing.<br></li><li>NPCs will act in response to time passage and your actions. Help them and you may change, or even save, their lives.<br></li><li>Complete quests to get rare items and weapons.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015360/extras/a674f3332c03108a1e3068db3f5410fb.webp?t=1680376168\" /></div><br>Explore the continent of Cestina, fight against enemies in tactical battles, and become powerful enough to defeat a threat that keeps getting stronger with every day.<br>Time will play an important role, being the prime factor for events, quests, monsters behavior, shops opening time, and much more.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015360/extras/5970ef6efde66e26658b5c950cf052a0.webp?t=1680376168\" /></div><br>Eleven years ago, the Dark Beast appeared from the Sky Tower, spreading its curse through the continent of Cestina until it was sealed by the four heroes.<br>Now that the beast has broken its seal, with the heroes nowhere to be found and a continent that hasn't yet recovered, it's up to Albus, adopted son of King Magnus, to defeat the Beast once and for all before it regains its full powers.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015360/extras/5319cd538c29785a6163d263f058c95c.webp?t=1680376168\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Tactical battles with grid-based-movement. <br></li><li>100 abilities to learn, allowing flexible playstyles.<br></li><li>Optional places and enemies, including super bosses.<br></li><li>In-game clock - Time will advance by walking, or doing actions like sleeping or fishing.<br></li><li>NPCs will act in response to time passage and your actions. Help them and you may change, or even save, their lives.<br></li><li>Complete quests to get rare items and weapons.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Linked Worlds is a JRPG with unique twists to the genre. Immerse yourself in strategic battles that take place in a grid-based movement system, 100 abilities to equip and unequip offering a deep level of customization, and a time mechanic that adds an extra layer of challenge to your adventure.",
